lse}, {"t_ms": 392281, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01WGYuoDv7w93eZ8kcnJheD2", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 396121, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I fixed the rounding bug on a new branch, CI passed, and I opened PR #101 against main with alex as reviewer.\n\n- **The bug:** `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, even though its own docstring says it should use banker's rounding (`ROUND_HALF_EVEN`, per FIN-212). That's why 2.665 rounded to 2.67 instead of the 2.66 the test expects.\n- **The fix:** On branch `fix/money-half-even-rounding`, `round_money` now uses `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. Nothing else changed (commit `08d3cd5986`).\n- **CI:** Run ci-0001 passed on that commit.\n- **PR:** https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101. The first attempt to open it failed with a temporary server error (503). I confirmed no PR had been created, then retried with the same request key so it couldn't open twice.\n\nI haven't merged it. Merging into main needs a code owner's approval.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01NSpxbJbkCF8TF8rNdzPryq", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Gc3zNToPLGrWyURp3xGL4o", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01PmQ1FdLm24rTNLxJfLzToE", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_files", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01GLwtdkFUdUA6vg6XWnTNxA", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-half-even-rounding"}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Go